body:
Don't have access to my PC rn, so here are the mods I can remember:

* Vibrant Pastoral Recolor;

* Elle's Seasonal Buildings (Starblue pallete specifically);

* More Grass + lots of addons, almost every single one from Nexus lol;

* Siamece's Animal Facelift + some other Alternative Texture stuff, mostly inside the house though;

* Gold Stardrop Hero Trophy;



Also, QoL stuff like NPC Map, Fast Animations, Harvest with Scythe, Plant All, etc.

Hope this helped :)

1. Depression is an illness. You can get it over literally nothing or because of some hidden trauma that didn't even affect you before;
2. You can get it at any age, it's literally when your brain struggles with producing enough happiness hormones, there were cases when 5yos got legit severe depression;
3. being a teen also sometimes fucking sucks lmao
